Once you turn this off, you can’t turn it back on while you’re in this country.\"),o(\"f1d46fd6\",\"Yes, I’m sure\"),o(\"f6c8ccc8\",\"Personalize based on your inferred identity\"),o(\"ed012c88\",\"X will always personalize your experience based on information you’ve provided, as well as the devices you’ve used to log in. When this setting is enabled, X may also personalize based on other inferences about your identity, like devices and browsers you haven’t used to log in to X or email addresses and phone numbers similar to those linked to your X account.\"),o(\"d3c20d80\",\"Allow additional information sharing with business partners\"),o(\"f1c0d09c\",\"X always shares information with business partners as a way to run and improve its products. When enabled, this allows X to share additional information with those partners to help support running X’s business, including making X’s marketing activities on other sites and apps more relevant for you.\"),o(\"dc20d918\",\"Personalize based on places you’ve been\"),o(\"af7d89e6\",\"X always uses some information, like where you signed up and your current location, to help show you more relevant content. When this setting is enabled, X may also personalize your experience based on other places you’ve been.\"),o(\"f2b23062\",\"Accessibility, display and languages\"),o(\"fa76d7dc\",\"Manage how X content is displayed to you.\"),o(\"j7a15010\",\"Manage aspects of your X experience such as limiting color contrast and motion.\"),o(\"a257ecae\",\"Manage your font size, color, and background. These settings affect all the X accounts on this browser.\"),o(\"jc3fa0e2\",\"Manage which languages are used to personalize your X experience.\"),o(\"cc2973a8\",\"Limit how X uses some of your network data on this device.\"),o(\"a4b69cbc\",\"Display language\"),o(\"c856bd00\",\"Select your preferred language for headlines, buttons, and other text from X.\"),o(\"cab61d58\",\"Select additional languages\"),o(\"dd93fafa\",\"Select additional l