\"),o(\"bc2399a0\",\"Write and rate notes without sharing your X identity.\"),o(\"d939cf16\",\"Focus on the content\"),o(\"a56f0c32\",\"Aliases can help reduce bias by helping contributors focus more on content, and less on authors.\"),o(\"d17c59e4\",\"Everyone remains accountable\"),o(\"i719f8e2\",\"You can see contributors’ histories, and everyone is accountable through ratings they earn.\"),o(\"a96bb564\",\"Choose your Community Notes alias\"),o(\"afcdcf84\",\"This alias will be your identity when writing and rating Community Notes. It’s not associated with your X profile.\"),o(\"f83d0446\",\"Your alias has been saved.\"),o(\"ed0e6b2e\",\"Start rating notes\"),o(\"if4c5e06\",\"Welcome to Community Notes!\"),o(\"g880a78a\",\"Start by rating notes\"),o(\"d1be2236\",\"Community Notes relies on contributors like you to help identify helpful notes to show to everyone.\"),o(\"af9f2b78\",\"Track your Rating Impact\"),o(\"af68afc8\",\"Your Impact goes up every time you help a note get the status of Helpful or Not Helpful.\"),o(\"fb5c5d42\",\"Unlock the ability to write notes\"),o(\"a1e58cdc\",\"Once your Rating Impact reaches 5 or higher, you’ll unlock the ability to write your own Community Notes.\"),o(\"j5f112b4\",\"Two of your recent notes currently have the status of Not Helpful.\"),o(\"ac34c5e8\",\"Enough contributors, including ones who’ve disagreed with each other in their past ratings, agreed that 2 of your notes are not helpful. Here’s their feedback:\"),o(\"ib7886d0\",\"See these notes on your profile\"),o(\"b0a7d360\",\"You’re at risk of being temporarily locked out from writing notes.\"),o(\"e473f876\",\"Contributors whose 5 most recent notes with a status of Helpful or Not Helpful include 3 Not Helpful notes have their ability to write temporarily locked.\"),o(\"ef490ae8\",\"Sources not included or unreliable\"),o(\"bf3dc462\",\"Sources do not support note\"),o(\"heb35e12\",\"Incorrect information\"),o(\"ib117532\",\"Harassment or abuse\"),o(\"a7bc3192\",\"C