mage may be misleading?\"),o(\"add096c6\",\"Why do you believe this video may be misleading?\"),o(\"eb604e2e\",\"Why do you believe the linked page may be misleading?\"),o(\"c33bc7d4\",\"It contains a factual error\"),o(\"aadb676c\",\"It contains outdated information that may be misleading\"),o(\"g21a0ef4\",\"It is a misrepresentation or missing important context\"),o(\"daf354de\",\"It presents an unverified claim as a fact\"),o(\"d1d2ef84\",\"It is a joke or satire that might be misinterpreted as a fact\"),o(\"bfee6064\",\"Why do you believe this post is not misleading?\"),o(\"dfd1f7f0\",\"Why do you believe this image is not misleading?\"),o(\"b8623176\",\"Why do you believe this video is not misleading?\"),o(\"ec66e3fc\",\"Why do you believe the linked page is not misleading?\"),o(\"g228df26\",\"It expresses a factually correct claim\"),o(\"h890a3f2\",\"It was correct when shared, but is out of date now\"),o(\"hf607a0a\",\"It is clearly satirical/joking\"),o(\"j6ac7742\",\"It expresses a personal opinion\"),o(\"b1d82aae\",\"Did you link to sources you believe most people would consider trustworthy?\"),o(\"ae859ee0\",\"Is your note about the post or the image?\"),o(\"ba84e7f8\",\"Is your note about the post or the video?\"),o(\"ibb784c6\",\"About this specific post\"),o(\"a21ecb8c\",\"About the image in this post, and should appear on all posts that include this image\"),o(\"he0ca8da\",\"About the video in this post, and should appear on all posts that include this video\"),o(\"d0bf8d34\",\"Is your note about the post, or link?\"),o(\"db370b9a\",\"Is your note about the post, image, or link?\"),o(\"c35bf10e\",\"Is your note about the post, video, or link?\"),o(\"d96ce0d2\",\"This note is written in a way that will be helpful on all posts that include this image.\"),o(\"a1fb516c\",\"This note is written in a way that will be helpful on all posts that include this video.\"),o(\"be46a61e\",\"This note is written in a way that will be helpful on all posts that include