to do so here in \"+e.numDaysToRejoin+\" day\"+r(e.numDaysToRejoin,\"\",\"s\")+\".\"}),o(\"a490bc51\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"c94ad3e8\",\"send us feedback\"),o(\"ee160790\",\"Deleted notes\"),o(\"b3de4a42\",\"Rating Impact\"),o(\"a7b0393c\",\"Writing Impact\"),o(\"id568acc\",\"Top Writer\"),o(\"e25f9ad6\",\"Ratings that helped a note earn the status of Helpful\"),o(\"a0697fbc\",\"Nice work! These ratings identified Helpful notes that get shown as context on posts and help keep people informed.\"),o(\"a3311a60\",\"These ratings identified Helpful notes that get shown as context on posts and help keep people informed.\"),o(\"bbc44f5a\",\"These ratings identify Helpful notes that get shown as context on posts and help keep people informed.\"),o(\"b4f21858\",\"Ratings that helped a note reach the status of Not Helpful\"),o(\"d46b6bc8\",\"These ratings improve Community Notes by giving feedback to note authors, and allowing contributors to focus on the most promising notes.\"),o(\"a5e6ba6a\",\"Ratings of Helpful on notes that ended up with a status of Not Helpful\"),o(\"a22929e4\",\"Ratings of Not Helpful on notes that ended up with a status of Helpful\"),o(\"b76dd726\",'These ratings are common and can lead to status changes if enough people agree that a \"Helpful\" note isn’t sufficiently helpful.'),o(\"j29cc0f2\",\"These ratings are counted twice because they often indicate support for notes that others deemed low-quality.\"),o(\"cd4333d0\",\"Don’t worry, everyone gets some of these! \"),o(\"e9fa53ac\",\"Ratings on notes that don’t currently have a status of Helpful or Not Helpful.\"),o(\"fc664dee\",\"Ratings made after a status was reached\"),o(\"f024ec64\",\"These ratings can strengthen a note’s status, or help overturn it.\"),o(\"e1ee08e6\",\"Writing impact\"),o(\"je3fc324\",\"Your notes that earned the status of Helpful\"),o(\"f7358242\",\"Notes that earned the status of Helpful\"),o(\"j8e9b514\",\"Well done! These notes are now showing to everyone who sees the post,