t\"),o(\"g9a28bde\",\"Browse notes that need help\"),o(\"dc0046e2\",\"Browse the Community Notes home\"),o(\"fecae168\",\"There, you’ll find notes that need more ratings, and where your rating specifically can help.\"),o(\"h525e29e\",\"Help find notes that could be helpful to many people\"),o(\"f6db7706\",\"The best Community Notes directly address the post’s claim, are written in helpful and clear language, and add sources that a wide range of people would find reliable.\"),o(\"f636b582\",\"Help find notes that aren’t helpful\"),o(\"f58f4f62\",\"Rating low quality notes improves Community Notes by giving feedback to note authors, and allowing contributors to focus on the most promising notes.\"),o(\"cf30af22\",\"Did you know?\"),o(\"d145b0fa\",\"Note statuses aren’t reached by majority rule. To identify notes that are helpful to a wide range of people, note statuses require agreement between contributors who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps prevent one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"c20a24cc\",\"Congratulations!\"),o(\"d01b8fc8\",\"You’re a top Community Notes writer.\"),o(\"jbe2ad46\",\"Writers with a high Writing Impact and a high proportion of notes with a status of “Helpful” get access to:\"),o(\"d2dc3d4c\",\"Priority for note alerts\"),o(\"heb73816\",\"Top Writers’ note proposals are more likely to trigger notifications to get rater’s attention.\"),o(\"b760d51a\",\"Badge in alias profile\"),o(\"ief63e50\",\"Top Writers can be identified by a badge in their Community Notes profile.\"),o(\"jd6b88ca\",\"Notes about media\"),o(\"c39bdf5a\",\"Top Writers can write notes about media featured on multiple posts, keeping many more people better informed.\"),o(\"d8361d0a\",\"Suggestion on a Collaborative Note\"),o(\"jba34c04\",\"View feedback\"),o(\"c393f116\",\"Suggestion incorporated\"),o(\"e5d18abe\",\"Suggestion not incorporated\"),o(\"ac9c3858\",\"Suggestion is awaiting feedback\"),o(\"efb9a9e0\",\"Nothing to see here\"),o(\"a1529ce7\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"f07ed596\",\"Contributors like you collectively help identify Helpful notes to be shown as context on X and keep people informed.\"),o(\"h2b5268a\",\"Well done! Rate more notes to continue growing your impact.\"),o(\"e86c87a0\",\"Rate more notes\"),o(\"ad98f836\",\"Your Rating Impact went negative. Don’t worry!\"),o(\"e2d7c914\",\"Continue rating notes\"),o(\"a5427624\",\"Browse the Community Notes home to find notes that need ratings from more contributors.\"),o(\"e227a7fa\",\"Note statuses can always change\"),o(\"eda73c9c\",\"Your ratings will, sometimes, disagree with the status on a note. That’s not a problem! If more contributors agree with you, the status can be overturned, and your impact will change.\"),o(\"cfa3b664\",\"You can now write Community Notes!\"),o(\"j44125ee\",\"This contributor hasn’t written any notes yet.\"),o(\"da55067c\",\"Check this space later!\"),o(\"a123a58a\",\"Learn more about suggestions\"),o(\"had43d26\",\"This contributor hasn’t written any suggestions yet.\"),o(\"ba17d826\",\"Once you unlock the ability to write notes, you can earn the ability to suggest improvements on notes, too.\"),o(\"cbfd875c\",\"Unlock the ability to suggest improvements on notes\"),o(\"f5acb6f5\",function(e){return\"Once your Writing Impact reaches \"+e.cutoff+\" or higher, you’ll be able to suggest improvements on notes.\"}),o(\"f260c0ff\",function(e){return\"Once your Rating Impact reaches \"+e.cutoff+\" or higher, you’ll be able to suggest improvements on notes.\"}),o(\"c27db2e8\",\"You can suggest improvements on notes!\"),o(\"f893c3b8\",\"Join Community Notes\"),o(\"a701795c\",\"No Community Notes yet\"),o(\"db08295e\",\"Want to join?\"),o(\"ha275800\",\"Looks like you’re not a part of the Community Notes pilot program. Join now to help people stay better informed.\"),o(\"ce0a213a\",\"To create a note, select the Community Notes icon in any post’s menu. Notes you create will show up here.\"),o(\"c87f3cf8\",\"Note\"),o(\"a5b19492\",\"This note does not exist\"),o(\"c21d1b2a\",\"Notes reach a status of Helpful or Not Helpful once there is agreement from enough contributors, including people who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps ensure notes are helpful to a wide range of people, and prevents one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"c7b59cde\",\"Community Notes settings\"),o(\"c20d0df5\",\"Find out more.\"),o(\"a4293384\",\"Current version\"),o(\"i5bc774a\",\"Previous versions\"),o(\"cb491d96\",\"No previous revisions\"),o(\"fb4ae7d0\",\"Loading revision history\"),o(\"ae2c3e0a\",\"This revision history does not exist\"),o(\"d19ba24e\",\"This note does not have revision history\"),o(\"a48a6d9a\",\"Suggestion feedback\"),o(\"j6407c18\",\"Suggestion\"),o(\"c8e6202c\",\"Original note version\"),o(\"jfed4e7c\",\"Updated note version\"),o(\"ad544b60\",\"Loading suggestion feedback\"),o(\"c1dbc84c\",\"This suggestion does not exist\"),o(\"g5f06d2a\",\"No feedback yet\"),o(\"d9752faa\",\"Not published\"),o(\"abccc5b0\",\"Why it was incorporated\"),o(\"c4f5ffcc\",\"Why it was not incorporated\"),o(\"if64e2aa\",\"Why it was published\"),o(\"i21e6d60\",\"Why it was not published\"),o(\"a5a2330c\",\"Posts with the same media\"),o(\"ad071b5c\",\"Posts featuring the same link\"),o(\"b92967c0\",\"This note is not a media note\"),o(\"i92fddce\",\"Note automatically shows on the posts below if enough people agree it should.\"),o(\"f5ce7a00\",\"This media post doesn’t have any matches yet.\"),o(\"h3e2664c\",\"This media does not have a history\"),o(\"j2cc496c\",\"This media does not have a prominent post in its history\"),o(\"c3dd6d4a\",\"Loading media history\"),o(\"bc0a3164\",\"Most Liked\"),o(\"ca737d42\",\"AI analysis\"),o(\"ce3941fc\",\"AI can make mistakes, verify its outputs.\"),o(\"c767edeb\",function(e){return\"Matching post\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"b707d7a8\",\"Earliest exact match found\"),o(\"e1288bdc\",\"Alerts when a note needs help\"),o(\"ca14eab4\",\"Receive notifications when a Community Note needs your rating.\"),o(\"gb2bc3d0\",\"I’m all in 🔥\"),o(\"c35ebcd2\",\"As many as I can help with – up to a few per day\"),o(\"ba165b3c\",\"Often\"),o(\"g72e2a58\",\"A few alerts per week\"),o(\"idd249e0\",\"Sometimes\"),o(\"if2e01ee\",\"A few alerts per month\"),o(\"fdaeaab8\",\"There was an error saving your settings, please try again.\"),o(\"db4e443a\",\"Your settings have been saved.\"),o(\"dc11636c\",\"Languages you speak\"),o(\"fae059c6\",\"Leave Community Notes program\"),o(\"ed37123a\",\"You’re leaving the Community Notes program\"),o(\"c1a554a2\",\"Here’s what you should know:\"),o(\"j59355fe\",\"You won’t be able to write new Community Notes.\"),o(\"c23420ec\",\"You won’t receive notifications from Community Notes, unless they are related to your activity on X.\"),o(\"c76031ee\",\"Your anonymous Community Notes profile and past submissions will remain publicly available. You will still be able to see and delete your notes.\"),o(\"be4f9106\",\"You can rejoin after 90 days.\"),o(\"c62b12b4\",\"About Community Notes\"),o(\"hf68e810\",\"Community Notes is a program that aims to create a better-informed world. It empowers people on X to collaboratively add helpful notes to posts that might be misleading.\"),o(\"jdb52860\",\"Contributors write and rate notes\"),o(\"c104025c\",\"Contributors are people on X, just like you, who chose to enroll in the pilot to write and rate notes. The more people that participate, the better the program becomes.\"),o(\"j7872b8c\",\"Only notes that people find helpful appear on a post\"),o(\"fb59415e\",\"In order to be shown publicly as context on the post, a note needs to be rated helpful by enough people from different points of view. This approach helps avoid bias and manipulation, and helps find notes that are helpful to many people.\"),o(\"f9a44022\",\"X, the company, doesn’t choose what shows up: the people do\"),o(\"gdf4fbb2\",\"X, the company, doesn’t write, rate or moderate notes (unless they break the X Rules). We believe giving people voice to make these choices together is a fair and effective way to add information that helps people stay better informed.\"),o(\"cc720e6a\",\"Community Notes is built on data transparency\"),o(\"j2fcd33a\",\"Data includes contributions up until\"),o(\"d4a6b322\",\"All Community Notes data are published here daily, so people have free access to analyze it, identify problems, and spot opportunities to make Community Notes better. We can’t wait to learn with you.\"),o(\"c359263a\",\"Learn how to use and analyze Community Notes data \"),o(\"b8a27fe2\",\"in our guide\"),o(\"j1c99e00\",\"Notes data\"),o(\"i6f69314\",\"Ratings data\"),o(\"b7e4c114\",\"Note status history data\"),o(\"d7f19114\",\"User enrollment status data\"),o(\"ae4ebaec\",\"Got Likes Pilot ratings data\"),o(\"b6008808\",\"Note request data\"),o(\"h786cd7a\",\"Notes data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"d0fe8052\",\"Ratings data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"c0427f94\",\"Note status history data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"g880d8c0\",\"User enrollment status data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"ab1b3d38\",\"Note request data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"d6869f80\",\"Got Likes Pilot data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"c43fb933\",\"X Developer Agreement and Policy\"),o(\"h92fe1be\",\"Unfortunately, Community Notes is not available to you at this time.\"),o(\"f0dc1434\",\"Community Notes is currently only available in the U.S.\"),o(\"f87c3588\",\"Boost timelines\"),o(\"g1033d86\",\"No boosted posts\"),o(\"a6b8ddda\",\"Boost some posts to see them here\"),o(\"j6e48d62\",\"Sign in to see your boosted posts\"),o(\"ed01abcc\",\"Sign in to see posts you can boost\"),o(\"eb8de654\",\"No boostable posts\"),o(\"ffdc7f18\",\"Posts you can boost will show here\"),o(\"c09de2d4\",\"Search timeline\"),o(\"ae111c99\",function(e){return'No results for \"'+e.query+'\"'}),o(\"i1801686\",\"This is an invalid search query. Please try a different one.\"),o(\"f77fe1c6\",\"My posts\"),o(\"a7090408\",\"Keyword\"),o(\"e7cee1f2\",\"Fil