 long does it take?\"),o(\"f600b6f0\",\"Request a handle purchase or swap using the Get Started button. We’ll respond with availability and pricing within 3 business days. After payment, we’ll transfer the handle to your chosen account within 1-2 days. Optionally, we can move the old handle to another account you own.\"),o(\"i8debc4a\",\"Do you offer discounts for multiple handles?\"),o(\"c5199f3c\",\"Yes, depending on the number of handles you purchase and the total size of the quote.\"),o(\"c20f923e\",\"I have a trademark - does that affect things?\"),o(\"b2fd4c15\",\"Trademark Policy\"),o(\"a690746e\",\"Get Priority Support\"),o(\"he2dc9b0\",\"Contact us by sending your organization’s handle and request details.\"),o(\"ed85ca9e\",\"Contact us by sending your business’s handle and request details.\"),o(\"e5e6479e\",\"Send us an email with your organization’s handle and the details of your inquiry to receive the fastest support.\"),o(\"dd0855d0\",\"Send us an email with your business’s handle and the details of your inquiry to receive the fastest support.\"),o(\"ica8392a\",\"Once we receive your request, we’ll review and prioritize it in the order it was received.\"),o(\"ed37e36e\",\"Important: Missing your organization’s handle or using a personal email may cause delays in processing your request.\"),o(\"b8e25b96\",\"Important: Missing your business’s handle or using a personal email may cause delays in processing your request.\"),o(\"eb0d4fe2\",\"Make a column\"),o(\"e93d2f8a\",\"Customize your experience by adding a variety of columns such as:\"),o(\"e8203d1e\",\"Searches\"),o(\"d82fd532\",\"DMs\"),o(\"c87babee\",\"And more...\"),o(\"f1990aa4\",\"Organize your columns with Decks\"),o(\"ib9c9a54\",\"Imagine having multiple desktops on X Pro. Tune out the noise and only focus on the topics and tools you need when you need them.\"),o(\"fb5ac13e\",\"Move a column\"),o(\"bd545b7e\",\"Click on these dots to drag and drop a column anywhere on your Deck.\"),o(\"a98513b6